{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109894554338131968", "3_2109894554312970240", "3_2109894554338119680", "3_2109894554279346176"]}, "author_id": "2035449334884610048", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109894563951419404"], "id": "2109894563951419404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“Durga Puja 2026”\n\nExclusive First Look: \n\nRajdanga Naba Uday Sangha \nRajdanga Amra Kajan Kalyan Samity \nNalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata #Bengali https://t.co/YKZkpDZ7j4", "url": "https://x.com/subhankar_avi95/status/2109894563951419404"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109692868306853888"]}, "author_id": "1496031788170371074", "created_at": "2026-10-12T17:09:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109692879937650764"], "id": "2109692879937650764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 217, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "This Pujo, the spirit of Shakti shines a little differently. 🧡\n\nAt College Square, VIDA’s removable batteries power an illuminated tribute to Maa Durga, celebrating the strength that inspires us to keep moving forward.\n\nCome experience Bengal’s #1 Shakti. ⚡️\n.\n.\n.\n[ VIDA, https://t.co/doqcNS1KpH", "url": "https://x.com/VidaDotWorld/status/2109692879937650764"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109677346382872576"]}, "author_id": "3051747481", "created_at": "2026-10-12T16:07:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109677348614250648"], "id": "2109677348614250648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ekdalia Evergreen Durga Puja 2026 🚆  Ballygunge Station থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? | Complete Route Guide https://t.co/oxDTQFBWCE https://t.co/gaTDBcxT3S", "url": "https://x.com/responsivelp/statu