#DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/GJTFcaDxwy", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541667170848837"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109541556541857793", "3_2109541571574292480", "3_2109541591484694528", "3_2109541606890328064"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-12T07:08:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109541619070599222"], "id": "2109541619070599222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 1414, "like_count": 86, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n🎨 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n🌟 The theme depicts the significance of water bodies in our life, and our deliberate attempt to not recognise its significance — leading to more water pollution.\n\n👉 THE MAA DURGA IDOL IS STUNNING!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/jxy1HxFhiK https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109541619070599222"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109537915839889408", "3_2109537962837102592", "3_2109538006206218241", "3_2109538081422614528"]}, "author_id": "1154229504199385088", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:54:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109538124703658350"], "id": "2109538124703658350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1215, "like_count": 100, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Divine &amp; Dreamy 🎨  A breathtaking pandal that reflects the artistic brilliance, cultural richness, and creative imagination of Bengal’s talented artists. 🎨🙏\n\nChorebagan Sarbojanin, \nKolkata Durgapuja2026 \n\n#durgapuja2026 #kolkatadurgapuja #durgapuja #culture #photooftheday https://t.co/p0PAsInzcC", "url": "https://x.com/Caperspectives/status/2109538124703658350"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109529627475546112", "3_2109529627496452096"]}, "author_id": "51580260", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:20:32.000Z", "edit_history